# Witness for LiveDonorProgress (#5840 S4), the re-arm race: the donor re-arms
# between its counted close and the link fence, the fence raises above its new epoch,
# and the one probed re-claim restores it. Red here shows the allowance is exercised.
MODULE: LiveDonorProgressReclaimAfterRearmRaceWitness
TARGET: LiveDonorProgress
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the live donor re-arms between its count and the link fence, is refused StaleEpoch at its current epoch, takes its one probed re-claim and keeps stamping
BOUNDS: WithStaleDonor = TRUE, WithPreArm = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1

--- FIND
LiveDonorProgress == WithStaleDonor => ((lDead \/ lStuck) => (dupRaised \/ lStaleLeaf))
--- REPLACE
LiveDonorProgress == WithStaleDonor => ~(lStamped /\ relEpoch > 0 /\ lAllow /\ ~lDead)
--- END
